## License compatibility

All third-party licenses encountered are permissive (MIT, Apache-2.0,
BSD, Zlib, CC0, Unlicense, Unicode-3.0, bzip2-1.0.6) and are compatible
with the MIT license under which this project is distributed.

`r-efi` reports LGPL-2.1-or-later in the full graph, but it is pulled
only by `getrandom`'s wasm-bindgen feature and is excluded from the
default Windows MSVC build. No LGPL code is linked into released
binaries.

